The VAE reference also credits the HuggingFace Team (2023).
The implementation in src/seedvr2 is a C++/CUDA port, with bounded convolution
scratch, streamed transformer blocks, overlapping spatial VAE tiling and
temporal segment orchestration. It does not embed Python or ComfyUI.

Model files are distributed separately by Comfy-Org/SeedVR2 on Hugging Face.
Their original tensor names and embedded positive_conditioning are read
directly; no converted model files are distributed with slopfab.
